{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284290","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1028429001:1":{"text":"Welcome back! Have you found the missing herbalists? Are they safe?","source_cn":"你们回来了，找到那两个失踪的植物学家了吗？他们还安全吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD79DFC98B0CDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028429002:1":{"text":"We found them, but...","source_cn":"人倒是找到了，不过嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6737BE61F02B7FCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1028429002":{"text":"We found them, but...","source_cn":"人倒是找到了，不过嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6737BE61F02B7FCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028429003:1":{"text":"So we were being used! Alas, my comrades suffered for nothing...","source_cn":"原来我们是被利用了！唉，让队员们平白受了不少苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2988061B91040B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028429004:1":{"text":"Hmph, that Adamant Syndicate snake should know what it's like to fall so ill!","source_cn":"哼，应该让黑金商会那家伙也尝尝被腐蚀生病的滋味！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD21613FD15396B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028429004":{"text":"Hmph, that Adamant Syndicate snake should know what it's like to fall so ill!","source_cn":"哼，应该让黑金商会那家伙也尝尝被腐蚀生病的滋味！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD21613FD15396B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028429005:1":{"text":"Thank you all! I was worried not everyone would make it back to the village, but now I feel relieved.","source_cn":"谢谢你们！我刚才还担心大家撑不到回村子呢，这下就放心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5C95D799B6D3B8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028429006:1":{"text":"I just hope when we return, those waiting for lumber won't be too angry...","source_cn":"只希望回到村子以后，那些等着用梁木的村民们别太生气……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBD8DB1856683C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028429007:1":{"text":"Ah, right! The old man in the village is still waiting to build his new home!","source_cn":"——啊，对哦！村里准备翻盖房子的大叔还在等着呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24B3EAA8BC1E7F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028429008:1":{"text":"I'll send out another team. As long as there are no more mishaps, there will still be enough timber to go around before the rainy season.","source_cn":"我会再派出一支采集队。只要不再出现意外，雨季前还来得及...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7014ED04456B49D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028429009:1":{"text":"It's unfortunate how much devastation the corruption caused.","source_cn":"可惜，林地又是被砍伐，又是被腐化，现在看上去满目疮痍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E21CC7030939085","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028429010:1":{"text":"I failed to complete our task, and now the forest is in such a poor state.","source_cn":"我没能带队完成这次的任务，反而把林场破坏成了这个样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE70A614652CB332","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028429011:1":{"text":"But it's not your fault! You led with bravery and took on a lot of responsibility. That's commendable in and of itself.","source_cn":"但这不是你的错！你能果断下令和勇于承担责任，已经做得很好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D3446BC319B722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028429012:1":{"text":"Captain, you should have more faith in our homeland. Look!","source_cn":"队长先生，你应该对我们的家园有更大的信心呀。你瞧——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12A545F5A8DE971","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028429013:2":{"text":"Even though trunks are all that remain of some of our trees, their roots remain firmly in the soil. Still alive, still growing...","source_cn":"林场中的树木，即使树干被砍伐了，根系都还牢牢地扎在土壤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B921318A4AA1272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028429014:1":{"text":"Wounds will heal, and life will begin anew.","source_cn":"而新芽总会从旧木上长出。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA744DEF9A85F6305","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028429015:1":{"text":"Fear not, soon enough this forest will be towering with trees once more.","source_cn":"放心吧，终有一天，这里会重新长满参天大树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8221660E2497537F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Here's the potion.","source_cn":"（递给他缓和药剂）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48FA1D69727F5023","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Here's the potion.","female":"Here's the potion.","variant_male_record_index":"61896","variant_female_record_index":"61897","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"(Explain the situation)","source_cn":"（向他说明事情原委）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh6